wireview-hwmon (1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Kernel hwmon module for WireView Pro II (via DKMS)
  * Daemon (wireviewd) for USB serial communication
  * CLI tool (wireviewctl) for scripting device commands
  * systemd service and udev rules

